<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Innerhadden sells Foodland stake.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Innerhadden sells Foodland stake.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Innerhadden Ltd said it has sold its 6.5 percent stake in Foodland Associated Ltd for A$37.8 million.</p>
<p>The company said the sale of its 6.812 million Foodland shares would lead to a pre-tax profit of A$7.15 million on the book value of the investment.</p>
<p>It said the sale followed the recent disposal by a subsidiary of its entire shareholding in Vision Systems Ltd which generated a pre-tax profit of A$1.5 million.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
